INSERT INTO `products` VALUES (3,'Air Jordan 1 Low','air-jordan-1-low','Inspired by the original that debuted in 1985, the Air Jordan 1 Low offers a clean, classic look that\'s familiar yet always fresh. With an iconic design that pairs perfectly with any \'fit, these kicks ensure you\'ll always be on point.','',3,1,8995.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-16 09:54:15','2026-07-16 09:54:15'),(10,'Apple iphone 13 mini','Apple-iphone-13-mini','iPhone 13. boasts an advanced dual-camera system that allows you to click mesmerising pictures with immaculate clarity. Furthermore, the lightning-fast A15 Bionic chip allows for seamless multitasking, elevating your performance to a new dimension. A big leap in battery life, a durable design, and a bright Super Retina XDR display facilitate boosting your user experience.','Display: 5.4-inch Super Retina XDR OLED >\nResolution: 2340 × 1080 pixels, 476 ppi >\nBrightness: 800 nits typical, 1,200 nits HDR >\nProtection: Ceramic Shield front, IP68 water and dust resistance >\nProcessor: Apple A15 Bionic chip >\nCPU: 6-core CPU >\nGPU: 4-core GPU >\nNeural Engine: 16-core Neural Engine >\nRear Camera: Dual 12MP camera system >\nMain Camera: 12MP, f/1.6 aperture, sensor-shift OIS >\nUltra-Wide Camera: 12MP, f/2.4 aperture, 120° field of view >\nCamera Features: Night mode, Deep Fusion, Smart HDR 4, Photographic Styles >\nVideo: 4K Dolby Vision HDR recording up to 60 fps >\nFront Camera: 12MP TrueDepth camera, f/2.2 aperture >\nStorage Options: 128GB, 256GB, 512GB >\nNetwork: 5G, 4G LTE, Wi‑Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.0 >\nSIM: Dual SIM, nano-SIM and eSIM >\nSecurity: Face ID facial recognition >\nLocation: GPS, GLONASS, Galileo, QZSS and BeiDou >\nBattery: Up to 17 hours video playback >\nCharging: Lightning connector, MagSafe up to 15W, Qi wireless up to 7.5W >\nFast Charging: Up to 50% in around 30 minutes with a 20W adapter or higher >\nOperating System: iOS >\nWidth: 64.2 mm >\nHeight: 131.5 mm >\nThickness: 7.65 mm >\nWeight: 140 g >\nBuild: Aluminium frame, glass back',2,NULL,64900.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-16 15:21:57','2026-07-16 16:02:05'),(12,'Apple iPhone 13','apple-iphone-13','iPhone 13. boasts an advanced dual-camera system that allows you to click mesmerising pictures with immaculate clarity. Furthermore, the lightning-fast A15 Bionic chip allows for seamless multitasking, elevating your performance to a new dimension. A big leap in battery life, a durable design, and a bright Super Retina XDR display facilitate boosting your user experience.','',2,NULL,79900.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-17 05:35:59','2026-07-17 05:35:59'),(13,'Apple iphone 13 Pro Max','apple-iphone-13-pro-max','Apple iPhone 13 Pro Max features a 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR display, A15 Bionic chip, 12MP triple camera system, and long-lasting battery. It delivers fast performance, premium design, and an excellent photography experience.','Display: 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR OLED\nProcessor: Apple A15 Bionic\nRAM: 6 GB\nStorage: 128 GB / 256 GB / 512 GB / 1 TB\nRear Camera: 12 MP + 12 MP + 12 MP\nFront Camera: 12 MP\nBattery: 4352 mAh\nOperating System: iOS\n5G: Yes\nFace ID: Yes\nColor: Sierra Blue, Silver, Gold, Graphite\nWarranty: 1 Year',2,NULL,129900.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-17 07:20:01','2026-07-17 07:20:01'),(14,'Apple iPhone 14 Pro Max','apple-iphone-14-pro-max','Apple iPhone 14 Pro Max is a premium flagship smartphone with a 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display, powerful A16 Bionic chip, Dynamic Island, 48MP Pro camera system, and all-day battery life. It delivers exceptional performance, stunning photography, and fast 5G connectivity.','Display: 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR OLED\nProcessor: Apple A16 Bionic\nRAM: 6 GB\nStorage: 128 GB / 256 GB / 512 GB / 1 TB\nRear Camera: 48 MP + 12 MP + 12 MP\nFront Camera: 12 MP\nBattery: 4323 mAh\nOperating System: iOS\nNetwork: 5G\nDynamic Island: Yes\nFace ID: Yes\nCharging: Lightning Port, MagSafe Wireless Charging\nColors: Deep Purple, Gold, Silver, Space Black\nWarranty: 1 Year',2,NULL,134900.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-17 14:42:26','2026-07-18 07:25:48'),(15,'Apple  iPhone 15 Pro Max','apple-iphone-15-pro-max','The Apple iPhone 15 Pro Max is Apple\'s premium flagship smartphone, featuring a lightweight titanium design, a powerful A17 Pro chip, a stunning 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR display with ProMotion, and a professional 48MP camera system with 5x optical zoom. It delivers exceptional performance, long battery life, USB-C connectivity, and advanced security with Face ID, making it ideal for photography, gaming, and everyday use. :contentReference[oaicite:0]{index=0}','Display: 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR OLED\nResolution: 2796 × 1290 pixels\nRefresh Rate: 120Hz ProMotion\nProcessor: Apple A17 Pro Chip\nRAM: 8 GB\nStorage: 256 GB / 512 GB / 1 TB\nRear Camera: 48 MP + 12 MP Ultra Wide + 12 MP 5x Telephoto\nFront Camera: 12 MP TrueDepth\nBattery: 4422 mAh\nOperating System: iOS\nNetwork: 5G\nSIM: Dual SIM (Nano-SIM + eSIM)\nUSB: USB-C\nWater Resistance: IP68\nSecurity: Face ID\nColors: Black Titanium, White Titanium, Blue Titanium, Natural Titanium\nWarranty: 1 Year',2,NULL,159900.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-17 15:10:26','2026-07-17 15:10:26'),(21,'Apple iPhone 16 Pro Max','apple-iphone-16-pro-max','The Apple iPhone 16 Pro Max is Apple\'s most advanced flagship smartphone, featuring a premium titanium design, a large 6.9-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display with ProMotion technology, the powerful A18 Pro chip, and an advanced 48MP Pro camera system. It delivers exceptional performance, AI-powered features, long-lasting battery life, USB-C connectivity, and 5G support, making it perfect for photography, gaming, content creation, and professional use.','Display: 6.9-inch Super Retina XDR OLED\nResolution: 2868 × 1320 pixels\nRefresh Rate: 120Hz ProMotion\nProcessor: Apple A18 Pro Chip\nRAM: 8 GB\nStorage: 256 GB / 512 GB / 1 TB\nRear Camera:\n• 48 MP Fusion Camera\n• 48 MP Ultra Wide Camera\n• 12 MP 5x Telephoto Camera\n\nFront Camera: 12 MP TrueDepth Camera\nOperating System: iOS 18\nBattery: Up to 33 hours video playback\nNetwork: 5G\nSIM: Dual SIM (Nano-SIM + eSIM)\nCharging: USB-C, MagSafe Wireless Charging\nSecurity: Face ID\nWater Resistance: IP68\nConnectivity: Wi-Fi 7, Bluetooth 5.3, NFC\nColors: Black Titanium, White Titanium, Natural Titanium, Desert Titanium\nWarranty: 1 Year',2,NULL,134900.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-17 18:07:06','2026-07-18 07:25:48'),(22,'Apple iPhone 17 Pro Max','apple-iphone-17-pro-max','Apple iPhone 17 Pro Max is expected to be Apple\'s next-generation flagship smartphone, featuring a premium titanium design, a large Super Retina XDR OLED display with ProMotion technology, the powerful A19 Pro chip, advanced AI-powered features, and a professional-grade camera system. It is expected to deliver exceptional performance, long battery life, USB-C connectivity, and enhanced photography and video capabilities for creators, gamers, and power users.','Display: 6.9-inch Super Retina XDR OLED\nRefresh Rate: 120Hz ProMotion\nProcessor: Apple A19 Pro Chip\nRAM: 12 GB\nStorage: 256 GB / 512 GB / 1 TB\nRear Camera:\n• 48 MP Main Camera\n• 48 MP Ultra Wide Camera\n• 48 MP Telephoto Camera\n\nFront Camera: 24 MP TrueDepth Camera\nOperating System: iOS 26\nNetwork: 5G\nSIM: Dual SIM (Nano-SIM + eSIM)\nCharging: USB-C Fast Charging\nWireless Charging: MagSafe Supported\nSecurity: Face ID\nWater Resistance: IP68\nConnectivity: Wi-Fi 7, Bluetooth 5.4, NFC\nBattery: All-day Battery Life\nBuild Material: Titanium Frame\nColors: Black Titanium, White Titanium, Natural Titanium, Blue Titanium\nWarranty: 1 Year',2,NULL,145900.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-17 18:52:34','2026-07-17 18:52:34'),(23,'Apple MacBook Pro M4 (16 GB RAM)','apple-macbook-pro-m4','Crafted from a durable aluminum unibody, the MacBook Pro M4 combines a sleek, lightweight design with outstanding build quality. It features a comfortable Magic Keyboard with Touch ID for secure and convenient authentication, along with a high-quality camera, studio-grade microphones, and an immersive six-speaker sound system for crystal-clear video calls and media playback. With fast SSD storage, long-lasting battery life, Thunderbolt/USB-C connectivity, and the seamless experience of macOS, the Apple MacBook Pro M4 is built to keep up with demanding workflows while offering the performance, portability, and reliability that users expect from Apple\'s flagship professional laptop.','',2,NULL,169900.00,2.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 05:07:26','2026-07-18 05:13:27'),(29,'Apple MacBook Pro M5 (16 GB RAM)','apple-macbook-pro-m5-16-gb-ram','Built with Apple\'s signature premium aluminum unibody design, the MacBook Pro M5 combines durability with portability while maintaining excellent thermal performance for sustained workloads. It features a responsive Magic Keyboard with Touch ID, a high-quality camera, studio-grade microphones, and a six-speaker sound system that delivers rich, immersive audio. With ultra-fast SSD storage, all-day battery life, Thunderbolt/USB-C connectivity, MagSafe charging, and the powerful macOS ecosystem, the Apple MacBook Pro M5 provides a seamless and productive computing experience. Whether you\'re working on professional projects, creating content, or managing everyday tasks, the MacBook Pro M5 is designed to deliver exceptional performance, reliability, and efficiency in every situation.','',2,NULL,97900.00,4.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 06:10:44','2026-07-18 06:10:44'),(30,'Samsung Galaxy Z Fold4 5G','samsung-galaxy-z-fold4-5g','The Samsung Galaxy Z Fold4 5G is a premium foldable smartphone designed for productivity and entertainment. It features a large 7.6-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X foldable display, a powerful Snapdragon 8+ Gen 1 processor, an advanced triple-camera system, and S Pen support. With 5G connectivity, multitasking features, and a durable Armor Aluminum frame, it delivers a flagship experience for work and play.','Display (Main): 7.6-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X\nCover Display: 6.2-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X\nResolution: 2176 × 1812 pixels\nRefresh Rate: 120Hz\nProcessor: Qualcomm Snapdragon 8+ Gen 1\nRAM: 12 GB\nStorage: 256 GB / 512 GB / 1 TB\nRear Camera:\n• 50 MP Wide\n• 12 MP Ultra Wide\n• 10 MP Telephoto (3x Optical Zoom)\n\nFront Camera:\n• 10 MP Cover Camera\n• 4 MP Under Display Camera\n\nBattery: 4400 mAh\nOperating System: Android\nNetwork: 5G\nSIM: Dual SIM (Nano-SIM + eSIM)\nCharging: 25W Fast Charging, Wireless Charging\nSecurity: Side-mounted Fingerprint Sensor\nWater Resistance: IPX8\nBuild: Armor Aluminum Frame\nConnectivity: Wi-Fi 6E, Bluetooth 5.2, NFC\nColors: Graygreen, Beige, Phantom Black\nWarranty: 1 Year',5,NULL,177999.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 06:11:53','2026-07-18 06:11:53'),(31,'Samsung Galaxy S23 Ultra 5G','samsung-galaxy-s23-ultra-5g','The Samsung Galaxy S23 Ultra 5G is Samsung\'s premium flagship smartphone, featuring a stunning 6.8-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X display, the powerful Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 for Galaxy processor, and an advanced 200MP quad-camera system. With S Pen support, AI-powered photography, 5G connectivity, and a long-lasting 5000mAh battery, it delivers exceptional performance for productivity, gaming, photography, and everyday use.','12 GB RAM | 512 GB ROM\nStore up to 10000 photos\nQualcomm Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 | Octa Core Processor | 3.36 GHz Clock Speed\nSuperfast Multitasking. Extensive Gaming\n200MP + 10MP + 12MP + 10MP Rear Camera\nDSLR Like Pictures & Great Zoom\n12MP Front Camera\nAttractive Selfies with Clear & Sharp Colours\n6.8 inch Full HD+ Dynamic AMOLED 2X Display\nCinematic Display. Sharpest Colours\n5000 mAh Battery\nCharging that can last up to 2 days*',5,NULL,139799.00,8.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 06:35:53','2026-07-18 06:40:07'),(32,'Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra 5G','samsung-galaxy-s24-ultra-5g','The Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra is Samsung\'s premium flagship smartphone, featuring a stunning 6.8-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X display, the powerful Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 for Galaxy processor, and an advanced 200MP AI-powered quad-camera system. Built with a durable titanium frame and integrated S Pen, it delivers exceptional performance, professional-grade photography, Galaxy AI features, and long-lasting battery life, making it ideal for productivity, gaming, and content creation.\n','Display: 6.8-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X\nResolution: 3120 × 1440 pixels (QHD+)\nRefresh Rate: 1Hz–120Hz Adaptive\nProcessor: Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 for Galaxy\nRAM: 12 GB\nStorage: 256 GB / 512 GB / 1 TB\n\nRear Camera:\n• 200 MP Wide\n• 50 MP Periscope Telephoto (5x Optical Zoom)\n• 10 MP Telephoto (3x Optical Zoom)\n• 12 MP Ultra Wide\n\nFront Camera: 12 MP\n\nBattery: 5000 mAh\nOperating System: Android 14 (Upgradable)\nNetwork: 5G\nSIM: Dual SIM (Nano-SIM + eSIM)\nCharging: 45W Fast Charging, 15W Wireless Charging, Wireless PowerShare\nSecurity: Ultrasonic In-display Fingerprint Sensor\nS Pen: Built-in\nWater Resistance: IP68\nBuild: Titanium Frame\nConnectivity: Wi-Fi 7, Bluetooth 5.3, NFC, USB Type-C\nColors: Titanium Black, Titanium Gray, Titanium Violet, Titanium Yellow\nWarranty: 1 Year',5,NULL,119999.00,7.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 07:07:41','2026-07-18 07:25:48'),(33,'Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra 5G','samsung-galaxy-s25-ultra-5g','The Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra is Samsung\'s most advanced flagship smartphone, featuring a premium titanium frame, a stunning 6.9-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X display, the powerful Snapdragon 8 Elite for Galaxy processor, and an advanced 200MP AI-powered camera system. With Galaxy AI features, a built-in S Pen, 5G connectivity, and a long-lasting 5000mAh battery, it delivers exceptional performance for photography, gaming, productivity, and professional content creation.','Display: 6.9-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X\nResolution: 3120 × 1440 pixels (QHD+)\nRefresh Rate: 1Hz–120Hz Adaptive\nProcessor: Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Elite for Galaxy\nRAM: 12 GB / 16 GB\nStorage: 256 GB / 512 GB / 1 TB\n\nRear Camera:\n• 200 MP Wide\n• 50 MP Ultra Wide\n• 50 MP Periscope Telephoto (5x Optical Zoom)\n• 10 MP Telephoto (3x Optical Zoom)\n\nFront Camera: 12 MP\n\nBattery: 5000 mAh\nOperating System: Android 15 (One UI 7)\nNetwork: 5G\nSIM: Dual SIM (Nano-SIM + eSIM)\nCharging: 45W Fast Charging\nWireless Charging: 15W\nReverse Wireless Charging: Yes\nSecurity: Ultrasonic In-display Fingerprint Sensor\nS Pen: Built-in\nWater Resistance: IP68\nBuild: Titanium Frame\nConnectivity: Wi-Fi 7, Bluetooth 5.4, NFC, USB Type-C\nColors: Titanium Black, Titanium Gray, Titanium Silver Blue, Titanium White Silver\nWarranty: 1 Year',5,NULL,129999.00,5.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 07:32:36','2026-07-18 07:32:36'),(34,'SONY ILCE-9III Mirrorless Camera','sony-ilce-9iii-mirrorless-camera','The Sony ILCE-9 III (Alpha 9 III) is Sony\'s flagship full-frame mirrorless camera designed for professional sports, wildlife, and action photography. It features the world\'s first full-frame global shutter image sensor, delivering blackout-free continuous shooting at up to 120 fps, exceptional autofocus performance, 4K video recording, and outstanding image quality. Built for speed, reliability, and precision, it is an ideal choice for professional photographers and videographers.','Model: Sony ILCE-9 III (Alpha 9 III)\n\nCamera Type: Full-Frame Mirrorless Camera\n\nSensor: 24.6 MP Full-Frame Exmor RS CMOS Global Shutter Sensor\n\nImage Processor: BIONZ XR\n\nLens Mount: Sony E-Mount\n\nISO Range: 250–25600 (Expandable: 125–51200)\n\nContinuous Shooting: Up to 120 fps\n\nAutofocus: 759 Phase-Detection AF Points with Real-time Tracking\n\nImage Stabilization: 5-Axis In-Body Image Stabilization (IBIS)\n\nViewfinder: 9.44M-dot OLED Electronic Viewfinder\n\nLCD Display: 3.2-inch Vari-angle Touchscreen LCD\n\nVideo Recording:\n• 4K UHD up to 120 fps\n• Full HD up to 240 fps\n• 10-bit 4:2:2 Internal Recording\n\nMemory Card Slots:\n• CFexpress Type A\n• SD UHS-II (Dual Slots)\n\nConnectivity:\n• Wi-Fi\n• Bluetooth\n• USB Type-C\n• HDMI\n• Ethernet\n\nBattery: Sony NP-FZ100 Rechargeable Battery\n\nBuild: Magnesium Alloy Body\n\nWeather Sealing: Dust and Moisture Resistant\n\nWeight: Approx. 702 g (with Battery & Memory Card)\n\nColor: Black\n\nWarranty: 1 Year',7,NULL,472990.00,9.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 08:37:19','2026-07-18 08:37:19'),(35,'Samsung Galaxy S26 Ultra 5G','samsung-galaxy-s26-ultra-5g','Built-in Privacy Display - Say hi to world\'s first Privacy Display on mobile. With this new layer of privacy, one can customize its screen with multiple viewability settings to ensure your everyday moments remain truly yours. Experience complete control with defense grade Knox security, on device protection and enjoy fast, reliable and secure payment anywhere with Samsung Wallet, Agentic AI Experience - Enjoy the pinnacle of mobile AI innovation with the easiest and effortless AI phone built to simplify everyday interactions and inspire confidence as the all-new Galaxy AI becomes truly intuitive and adaptive. The new Now Nudge intelligently reduces the steps and offers real-time suggestions. Find exactly what you are looking in just one quick search with Finder feature on Home screen. Add to it, the new One UI 8.5 personalizes your Galaxy in just a tap','',5,NULL,139999.00,9.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 09:08:39','2026-07-18 09:08:39'),(36,'SONY PlayStation5 Console','sony-playstation5-console','PlayStation5 Console The PS5 console unleashes new gaming possibilities that you never anticipated. *PS5 console (CFI-2000 model group slim)','',7,NULL,54900.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 09:38:21','2026-07-18 09:38:21'),(37,'PS5 Portal™ Remote Player','ps5-portal-remote-player','Put Your PS5 in the Palm of Your Hand PlayStation Portal Remote Player gives you access to the games on your PS5 console2 over your home Wi-Fi,1 letting you jump into gaming on a gorgeous 8” LCD screen capable of 1080p resolution play at 60fps,3 all without needing to play on a TV, Play Your Game Collection PlayStation Portal Remote Player can play compatible games you have installed on your PS5 console, including your favorite games for PS5 and PS4.2','',7,NULL,34999.00,6.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 15:51:17','2026-07-18 15:51:17'),(38,'SONY Playstation5 Digital Edition','sony-playstation5-digital-edition','PS5Console Digital Edition, Wireless controller, 2 Horizontal Stand Feet, HDMI cable, AC power cord, USB cable, printed materials, ASTROs PLAYROOM (Pre-installed game)','',7,NULL,49990.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 16:16:23','2026-07-18 16:16:23'),(39,'Xbox Series X 1TB Digital Gaming Console','xbox-series-x-1tb-digital-gaming-console','Take gaming to a whole new level with the Xbox Series X 1TB Gaming Console, a powerhouse designed to deliver unparalleled speed, performance, and stunning visuals. Powered by a custom AMD Zen 2 8-core processor and RDNA 2 GPU, this console offers 12 teraflops of raw graphical power, bringing next-generation gaming with real-time ray tracing, ultra-fast load times, and up to 120 FPS gameplay. Whether you\'re an eSports enthusiast, a casual gamer, or a home entertainment user, the Xbox Series X provides an immersive, seamless, and visually breathtaking experience. Key Features Unmatched Performance and Speed Ultra-Fast 1TB NVMe SSD allows quick game switching, lightning-fast load times, and near-instant resume. 120 FPS Gameplay with Variable Refresh Rate (VRR) for the most fluid and responsive gaming experience. Smart Delivery ensures you play the best available version of your games across console generations. True 4K Gaming and Visual Fidelity','',8,NULL,89900.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 17:01:01','2026-07-18 17:01:01'),(40,'Xbox Series X 1TB Disc Edition','xbox-series-x-1tb-disc-edition','Take gaming to a whole new level with the Xbox Series X 1TB Gaming Console, a powerhouse designed to deliver unparalleled speed, performance, and stunning visuals. Powered by a custom AMD Zen 2 8-core processor and RDNA 2 GPU, this console offers 12 teraflops of raw graphical power, bringing next-generation gaming with real-time ray tracing, ultra-fast load times, and up to 120 FPS gameplay. Whether you\'re an eSports enthusiast, a casual gamer, or a home entertainment user, the Xbox Series X provides an immersive, seamless, and visually breathtaking experience. Key Features Unmatched Performance and Speed Ultra-Fast 1TB NVMe SSD allows quick game switching, lightning-fast load times, and near-instant resume. 120 FPS Gameplay with Variable Refresh Rate (VRR) for the most fluid and responsive gaming experience. Smart Delivery ensures you play the best available version of your games across console generations. True 4K Gaming and Visual Fidelity','',8,NULL,99999.00,4.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 17:07:57','2026-07-18 17:07:57'),(41,'Sony DualSense Wireless Controller','sony-dualsense-wireless-controller','','',7,NULL,6399.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 17:38:07','2026-07-18 17:38:07'),(42,'Sony Dualsense Edge Wireless Controller','sony-dualsense-edge-wireless-controller','Changeable stick caps, remappable inputs and custom settings make your DualSense Edge wireless controller uniquely yours. Fine tune your aim by adjusting stick sensitivity and dead zones, set the travel distance of your triggers for faster inputs, and quickly swap between control profiles so you’re always ready for your next game, Swappable back buttons can be configured to any other button input, so you’ve always got game-changing actions and essential controls at your fingertips. Plus, with two different styles of button to choose from, you can pick an input type that feels just right for your playstyle.','',7,NULL,18999.00,4.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 17:43:49','2026-07-18 17:43:49'),(43,'DualSense Wireless Controller – Ghost of Yōtei Gold Limited Edition ​','dualsense-wireless-controller-ghost-of-y-tei-gold-limited-edition','Haptic Feedback: You are the Ghost. Feel the rumble of your horse’s gallop as you ride across a majestic Japanese countryside and feel the clang of perfectly forged steel as you battle your way toward revenge with the DualSense wireless controller, Adaptive Triggers: Steady your blade and prepare to execute surgically precise combos with the DualSense wireless controller’s adaptive triggers.','',7,NULL,14999.00,0.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-18 17:51:39','2026-07-18 17:51:39'),(45,'OnePlus Nord 5 5G','oneplus-nord-5-5g','The OnePlus Nord 5 5G is a premium mid-range smartphone designed to deliver flagship-level performance and an exceptional user experience. It features a vibrant 6.83-inch AMOLED display with a smooth 144Hz refresh rate, the powerful Snapdragon 8s Gen 3 processor, an advanced 50MP AI dual-camera system, and a large 6800mAh battery with ultra-fast 80W SUPERVOOC charging. With 5G connectivity and OxygenOS, it is perfect for gaming, photography, entertainment, and everyday productivity.','Model: OnePlus Nord 5 5G\n\nDisplay: 6.83-inch AMOLED\n\nResolution: 2800 × 1272 pixels (1.5K)\n\nRefresh Rate: 144Hz\n\nProcessor: Qualcomm Snapdragon 8s Gen 3\n\nRAM: 8 GB / 12 GB / 16 GB\n\nStorage: 256 GB / 512 GB\n\nRear Camera:\n• 50 MP Wide (OIS)\n• 8 MP Ultra Wide\n\nFront Camera: 50 MP\n\nBattery: 6800 mAh\n\nOperating System: OxygenOS (Android 15)\n\nNetwork: 5G\n\nSIM: Dual Nano-SIM\n\nCharging: 80W SUPERVOOC Fast Charging\n\nSecurity: In-display Fingerprint Sensor\n\nWater Resistance: IP65\n\nConnectivity:\n• Wi-Fi 6\n• Bluetooth 5.4\n• NFC\n• USB Type-C\n\nColors: Marble Sands, Dry Ice, Phantom Grey\n\nWarranty: 1 Year',10,NULL,34999.00,8.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-20 05:32:52','2026-07-20 05:32:52'),(46,'OnePlus Nord 6','oneplus-nord-6','The OnePlus Nord 6 is a premium mid-range smartphone built for speed, gaming, and all-day performance. It features a 6.78-inch 165Hz AMOLED display, the powerful Snapdragon 8s Gen 4 processor, a 50MP Sony AI camera, and a massive 9000mAh SiCarbon battery with 80W SUPERVOOC fast charging. With AI-powered features, 5G connectivity, and a durable IP66/IP68/IP69-rated design, it delivers an exceptional experience for gaming, photography, entertainment, and everyday productivity.','Model: OnePlus Nord 6\n\nDisplay: 6.78-inch Sunburst AMOLED\n\nResolution: 2772 × 1272 pixels (1.5K)\n\nRefresh Rate: Up to 165Hz\n\nProcessor: Qualcomm Snapdragon 8s Gen 4\n\nGPU: Adreno 825\n\nRAM: 8 GB / 12 GB LPDDR5X\n\nStorage: 256 GB UFS 4.1\n\nRear Camera:\n• 50 MP Sony LYTIA Main Camera (OIS)\n• 8 MP Ultra Wide Camera\n\nFront Camera: 32 MP\n\nBattery: 9000 mAh SiCarbon\n\nOperating System: OxygenOS 16 (Android 16)\n\nNetwork: 5G\n\nSIM: Dual Nano-SIM\n\nCharging:\n• 80W SUPERVOOC Fast Charging\n• 27W Reverse Wired Charging\n• Bypass Charging\n\nSecurity: In-display Fingerprint Sensor\n\nWater Resistance: IP66 / IP68 / IP69 / IP69K\n\nConnectivity:\n• Wi-Fi 7\n• Bluetooth\n• NFC\n• USB Type-C\n\nColors: Fresh Mint, Pitch Black, Quick Silver\n\nWarranty: 1 Year',10,NULL,44999.00,5.00,NULL,NULL,1,'active','2026-07-20 08:39:28','2026-07-20 08:49:55');
